              Sysops guide to a personal and secure system
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. If you are a newcomer to LogicBBS and previously been using /X.
   You can start off by changing default sysop/cosysop access level to be
   300 and 280, or just change it to values that differs from 255 and 240.
   As /X uses these as default SYSOP and CO-SYSOP access level. To prevent
   hacking by doors which might grant a user sysop access by some special
   key input, you must modify the defaults.

   This referes to commands: SYSOPACCLEVEL & COSYSOPACCLEVEL

